WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:10.790
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.600
The one who will make it is Ojou.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.000
Not to mention it's the Sachertorte, the King of Chocolate Cakes.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.900
With my aim to become a chocolatier, I can't afford to lose!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.780
closed captions

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.440
It's really tense.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.830
It'll be all right for Ichigo and the others. Right, Chocolat?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.280
I don't care.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.190
Are you still mad at Kashino?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.950
Isn't it about time you stop fighting and cheer for them?

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:32.050
I don't want that. I <i>definitely</i> won't cheer for Kashino!

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.360
And now, we'll start the Cake Grand Prix semifinals.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.670
First, Team Ichigo.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.300
The opposing team is Team Koshiro.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.410
I'll... win!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.060
