Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:46.510
recipe 25

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:46.510
Goodbye, Kashino

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:51.280
The semifinals topic is chocolate cake. The theme is "Love".

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:53.530
The time limit is three hours.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.190
Ready... Start!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.240
You two will make the Sachermasse.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.100
I'll make the Glaçage au chocolat.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.320
Understood.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.190
Umm, what should I do?

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:10.740
You'll make the Sachertorte batter. I'll make the chocolate for the coating!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:15.930
Let's start, Satou, Shiotani. We'll make a delicious Sachertorte.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.210
Yes, Ojou-sama.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:17.840
It'll be perfect!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.700
You're making a Sachertorte too?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.530
Does it concern you? Okay, but I'll give you a big service.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:26.020
I'll show you the cake I'll make.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:33.690
With a Sachertorte as the base, it's a love-love cake covered with lots of hearts.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.180
Wonderful, isn't it?

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.720
It looks alike. It's identical!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:45.740
Or rather, no matter how you look at it, it looks exactly like Ichigo-chan's style of florid arrangement.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.560
Amano, did you let them see our design?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.130
T-There is no way I'd do a thing like that!

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.930
Are you blaming your friends?

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.230
I'm only making sure!

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.780
You two, this is no time to fight!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:05.000
Ayukawa-san?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.990
I'm sorry I'm late, Ojou-sama.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:09.720
Wait a sec.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:14.720
Sensei, the fourth member of Team Koshiro has arrived.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:19.230
Eh? Ayukawa-san is the fourth member of Team Koshiro!?

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.520
You are not allowed to join as you are late.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.660
I'm sorry.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.830
Well, well. This has just started after all.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.410
Hurry up and join your group.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.060
Yes.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.220
I... let Ayukawa-san see our design...

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.860
Last night, when I was staying up thinking of an idea...

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:40.220
This.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:40.620
Eh?

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.970
Is this the cake you'll use for the Grand Prix?

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:49.470
Yeah, that's right. The base is Sachertorte. I figured I'd decorate it with lots of love.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.070
I told her everything.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:54.490
Then, as I figured, the design was stolen, huh?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:58.790
Idiot! Why did you tell that kind of thing to someone outside the team!?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.120
But she's a classmate...

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.910
I didn't think she'd be in Koshiro-san's team...

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:06.990
Ichigo-chan isn't the one to blame. The one to blame is the one stealing it.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.400
Ayukawa-san, why would you do something like this?

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.820
Did you approach me just to steal my cake design!?

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:14.800
What are you talking about?

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.700
But that's my design!

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.750
Stop accusing others. Do you have proof?

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.230
T-That's...

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.770
You coward!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.600
I shall bestow divine punishment onto you!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:34.020
Chocolat! You mustn't use your fork for violence!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.940
Get your composure! Calm down!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.810
Let me go!

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.190
What should I do..?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.650
Instead of feeling guilty about this, let's think of what to do next.

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:45.820
Should we change the cake's design?

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.690
At this point it's impossible.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:52.890
Earlier we made Ringo-chan a birthday cake, and the design was stolen at that time too, but we managed to do it, right?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:56.250
The situation that time was different. We're in the Grand Prix now!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:01.170
Even so, we need use all of our time to make the Sachertorte.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.660
We're running out of time! We have to go along with what we planned.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:12.680
Both teams are making Sachertorte. If their conversation earlier was true, there's a chance they'll look similar.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.170
Chairman, what shall we do?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.190
This truly is a Sweets Battle, isn't it?

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.970
The Sachertorte is a famous cake from Vienna, Austria.

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:29.390
It was so popular, in fact, that there was a trial involving the right to use the name.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:34.820
That trial lasted seven years, and is called the "Sweet Seven Years' War".

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:39.450
Because of that, the Sachertorte gained popularity around the world.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.000
Something was born from the aftermath of that battle...

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:47.280
What will this battle bring out, I wonder?

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.710
Let's witness this.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:52.810
Butter.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:53.550
Yes.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:54.140
Egg.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.290
Next, the chocolate.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.460
The almond and plum. After that, add the vanilla in.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.150
Yes!

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:05.910
It looks like they have harmonious cooperation in their procedure.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:09.940
What teamwork! Ojou is in the center of it and the others follow.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.570
Team Ojou, that's unexpected for them.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:19.690
How's my magnificent handling. If I get serious, nothing is impossible!

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:22.330
I can do anything I want to!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:28.410
Shiotani... Ojou-sama looks so happy while laughing out loud.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.170
Satou, Ojou-sama looks so optimistic.

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:36.630
We couldn't make Ojou-sama laugh during her childhood.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.470
Ojou-sama, it's perfect.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:41.150
Whatever we showed or gave to her, she always acted uninterested.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:40.600
Ojou-sama, it's perfect.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.190
Not once was she in high spirits.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:48.900
But after she went studying abroad, and met Kashino, she changed completely.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.770
Makoto-kuuun~

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:54.280
She goes to the academy happily; she laughs jubilantly, every day!

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:59.300
And now, she's come alive while making sweets!

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.410
And she looks so happy!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:07.710
Just watch, Amano Ichigo. The winner will be me.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.510
Our happiness is to see Ojou-sama's smile!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.080
That is our...

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.000
...Love!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.950
She's able to temper!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.230
As I thought, it's because of Monsieur Léon's power.

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:36.150
Because she was taught by a top class chocolatier, Ojou has found the secret to a professional's technique!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.150
Kashino!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.150
What's wrong?

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.990
You've been spacing out during the match. It's not like you.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.280
S-Sorry.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.070
This is... over 38°C!

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:50.240
Glaçage fondant chocolate's temperature must not exceed 32°C!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.810
What are you doing!?

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:52.870
That's impossible...

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.910
There's nothing wrong with the heating strength.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:56.470
Why?

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:58.540
Oh, what's the fuss about?

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:02.770
When he was preparing the chocolate,

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.810
I made the system blow in more hot air for them.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.180
For chocolate, temperature sense is essential, after all.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.380
You did well, Yohko.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.490
You're truly a talented person.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:18.630
Thank you very much.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.250
Help out over here too.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.200
Sure, Ojou-sama.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.950
There are a lot of people who want to become pâtissières.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:28.500
Just because the student graduated from St. Marie Academy, it doesn't ensure he or she will become one.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:33.520
In order to absolutely become a pâtissière, you need a strong backing.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.510
As long as I have the power from Château confectionery...

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.010
...it's fine if I'm hated. Being cursed is fine too.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:44.180
I want to become a pâtissière. No matter what I have to do.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:49.120
Ichigo is in a big pinch, isn't she?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.860
What exactly is going on now?

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.500
Kashino...

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:55.410
Whaat..?

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.900
It's a really warm wind.

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.400
Huh? It's really snugly.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.630
Whaaat..?

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:04.640
Caramel, can't you be quiet?

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:08.870
I'm sorry. The wind is so strong that it blew me away.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:09.650
Wind?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.320
Hey, isn't this strange?

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.080
What is?

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:19.500
But the windows and doors are closed. Where is the wind coming from?

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.540
When you say that...

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.420
Over there!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.880
Ichigo! There's a really warm wind blowing from over there!

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.930
Could that be the cause of it?

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:29.440
Huh?

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:30.940
The air conditioner?

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:35.710
It's true. Wind is blowing into this area.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.150
Moreover, it's warm!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.440
Can someone turn the air conditioner switch off? Please?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.700
Switch off the air conditioner, right?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.660
Leave it to me!

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.300
It stopped.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.550
But the chocolate is...

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:54.120
If we heat it up again...

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:59.170
No... The chocolate, once it becomes like this, the flavour will definitely degrade.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:02.460
Sensei, there's been an accident. This battle should be nullified!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.840
Don't be naïve.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:04.470
Eh?

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:07.360
The environment won't always be the same as before.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:13.430
Taking air temperature and humidity into account, and adjusting the temperature and cooling beforehand.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:19.700
Isn't accounting for all these things when making sweets the requirements for a pâtissière?

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:25.080
Ayukawa is right. Taking into account the environment in which you are operating is a crucial skill.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.420
My condolences.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.960
Is it possible that Ojou is behind this?

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.780
Dirty. This is a dirty trick!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.870
Exactly like an evil Empress!

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:44.890
No... We're... going to lose...

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:03.490
We can redo it again. If we rush it, we can make it in...

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.410
We won't make it in time.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.830
Kashino's hands always carry the smell of chocolate, don't they?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:14.870
Eh?

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:16.840
We know about it.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:23.680
That you're at it day after day, without fail, always practicing tempering.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.390
I believe it's your big love.

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:27.850
Love?

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:33.430
You really love making chocolate right? If you didn't, you wouldn't have made it this far.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:38.460
You say that you don't know what love is,
but there's lots of it in here, right?

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:39.970
That's nothing...

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.230
It is something.

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:45.000
Such a chocolate fool like you, no one can beat you in that aspect.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.620
At the very least, at this academy, you're the top ranked one.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.870
Hanabusa...

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:54.450
That's right. Those hands which are always covered with chocolate are an undeniable proof of that.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:55.250
Andou...

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.960
It's the chocolate you love, right? You can't give up.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.280
Let's do our best until the very end.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.590
I don't understand love...

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:10.910
...but the feelings I have that I want to make delicious chocolates, is stronger than anything.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.020
I can't afford to lose the chocolate battle.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.530
Everyone, please lend me a hand. I beg you.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.620
Of course.

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:20.250
Yes.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.230
It's obvious. We're a team, after all.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:30.740
I felt that with my skills, I'd be able to accomplish it alone somehow, and got conceited.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:52.360
I can do it alone, but if I have the help of my friends,

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.970
we should be able to make it even better.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:59.560
Just like the variations of the Sachertorte in every country as it spreads around the world.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.580
For the sake of my friends, I won't give up...

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.010
...until the very end.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.110
It's done!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:12.080
Look at this! It's my amazing Sachertorte.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:12.580
Huh?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:18.200
Okay!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:19.750
After is the decorations.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.490
There's no time left!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.670
Ichigo-chan, hurry up!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.180
Stop right there.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:39.190
The time limit of 3 hours is up. Put down your hands.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.760
The decoration was a little rushed.

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:45.360
But I'm sure it'll be all right.

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:49.820
Then, starting with the team who finished first, Team Koshiro's cake.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.880
I think there's a lot of different kinds of love.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:58.000
The shapes, colours, sizes and weights of it all depends on the person, being different for everyone.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.540
With that in mind, this cake is born!

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:06.420
It's exactly the same as the concept that Amano-san thought up.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.560
It's no doubt they stole this information from us.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:18.460
Even now, the person I love most is here. Inside my chest, my heart is filled with love for that person!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.600
Similar to how this cake looks.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:25.940
Yeah. There is a big heart inside the chest. That's what true love is about.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:30.020
Oh? Is that what Karashima-sensei has experienced?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.040
I'm remembering about the past...

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:36.160
It's true that this cake conveys a strong feeling.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.830
It's not bad.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.370
It's deliciously made.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.950
Thank you very much.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.840
Next is Team Ichigo.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:48.830
Oh.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.120
This is beautiful.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:52.840
Almost like a mirror.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:56.290
It's the first time that I've seen someone arrange it like a mirror.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.440
Monsieur Léon.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.310
His own fork?

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:10.860
Très bien.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:15.150
That's amazing, Kashino. Monsieur Léon is saying it's splendid.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:19.410
We did it! Kashino's chocolate was recognized by a professional chocolatier.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:25.350
He knows that your skills are the real thing.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.560
Hey, Kashino.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:31.790
Merci.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.680
Hey, Léon! Where are you going?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.490
Won't you listen to my orders!?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.250
Please wait, Monsieur Léon.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.930
Listen to what Ojou-sama has to say...

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:48.620
Ojou-sama, Léon said he has repaid his favour...

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.940
...and that he's going back to France.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.510
I will tell Papa!

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:56.950
I won't sponsor the highest quality chocolate to your shop! Is that fine with you!?

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.950
Geez! He's so self-centered.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:07.780
Doing a Sachertorte with heart decorations look similar to Team Koshiro's.

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:09.610
What's your cake's concept?

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.000
Umm... well...

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:21.450
I... This time the theme, I honestly don't understand it.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:27.230
But during the time everyone in the team was helping out, I felt like I started to understand it a little.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.410
This is made with our hearts.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.470
With that, please taste the cake.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:32.730
Please!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:36.240
Oh? Humans are interesting, aren't they?

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:40.080
I'll announce the Cake Grand Prix semifinal results.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:44.080
Flavour, Skills, Theme, Completion.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.900
Each of these will be rated from 1-10.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.490
First is Flavour and Skills.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.840
Team Koshiro.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:55.490
Flavour is 7 points. Skills is 6 points. Total is 13 points.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:56.730
Team Ichigo.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:59.540
Flavour is 9 points, Skills is 10 points. Total is 19 points.

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:00.900
Yes!

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.640
Why? How?

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.810
I got special training from a professional!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:12.840
Tempering takes years to learn. You can't do it with just a little special training.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.110
Kashino-kun. Your skills are evident here.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:19.300
Thank you very much.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:25.040
<i>That's expected of my Makoto-kun. But it's frustrating!</i>

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:27.500
Next is Theme and Completion.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.570
Team Koshiro.

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:32.550
Theme is 10 points. Completion is 9 points.

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.890
Theme is 7 points, Completion is 5 points.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.310
Total:

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:41.470
Team Koshiro, 32 points.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.370
Team Ichigo, 31 points.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.020
Result: Team Koshiro wins.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.070
Yes!

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.360
Congratulations, Ojou-sama!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:55.730
That's a big victory!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:58.460
We lost...

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:00.880
That can't be...

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:05.910
It's my fault. I let them see our design.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.890
No! Amano, it's not your fault.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:12.660
But with this, our participation in Grand Prix is over.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.470
It's not over yet.

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:20.080
"It's not over yet", what do you mean?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:24.680
The Grand Prix has only just begun. You have more chances.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.210
There's the match for the 3rd place, after all.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.250
The match to decide the 3rd place?

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:36.080
I totally forgot about the 3rd place match.

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:39.530
Yeah. If we win that, the road to Paris is open to us.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.610
Kashino, let's do our best next time too!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:42.460
Together with us again, okay?

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:43.950
It's impossible for you to do it together.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:48.950
Makoto-kun, you promised us, didn't you?
If you lose, you'd join Team Koshiro.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.900
He definitely did promise.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.290
We have proof.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.280
If you do<i> lose, I'll have you join my team.</i>

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:58.990
Fine.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.930
This is love, or rather, an Empress's implacableness.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.630
Makoto-kun! Come on!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.020
W-Wait!

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:13.770
The opposing team used underhanded tricks. You don't have to go!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.730
Even so, a promise is a promise.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.580
For everything until now, thank you.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.860
I'm happy I was in your team.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.250
Kashino...

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:26.910
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:30.950
For being such a foolish partner... I'm sorry.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.460
Kashino!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.170
You should choose a better, more fitting partner this time.

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:42.610
Idiot! Idiot! You're really an idiotic moron!

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:46.020
No matter what happens, we'll always be partners!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.390
Makoto-kun!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.900
<i>Look closely, Amano Ichigo. Makoto-kun belongs to me now.</i>

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.730
So, let's go. My darling.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:14.830
Henri-sensei. Kashino... One of our friends is going away.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.220
What should we do?

