00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:04.460
Sachertorte.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:12.540
Chocolate snack representation of Austria, Sachertorte.

00:23:13.110 --> 00:23:15.870
These are the ingredients used in it.

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:23.800
Sachertorte has flour, butter, chocolate and marmalade for the batter to make the chocolate butter cake.

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:29.290
After you spread the apricot jam on the base, coat it with melted chocolate fondant through the center.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.280
It looks delicious!

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:41.000
Originally, the recipe to make the "Original Sacher" was a closely guarded secret.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:46.720
Afterwards, due to a trial by a well-known store named Demel in Vienna, Sachertorte became a famous sweet.

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:50.100
Even now, it's one of the most well-known sweets in the world.

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:58.230
As the flavour is rich, thus even now, it's called the King of Chocolate Cakes and remains famous.

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:04.360
